---
/* Component — CardFooter
 * The card's action row. A gap-override on daisyUI's own .card-actions, which
 * supplies display:flex, flex-wrap and a gap; bravoixr overrides the gap with
 * its own token and adds what daisyUI leaves out — end alignment, the bottom
 * pin, and a minimum gap above the actions.
 *
 * display:flex is redeclared rather than left to daisyUI so the box model here
 * is self-contained, matching the precedent .navbar and .footer set in page.css.
 *
 * justify-content:flex-end is flow-relative inside a flex container, so it
 * mirrors under RTL with no physical left/right.
 *
 * margin-block-start:auto pins the row to the card's bottom edge when the card
 * is taller than its content. That depends on Card being a flex column — which
 * comes from daisyUI's rented .card — and it only works when CardFooter is the
 * *last child*. Placed anywhere else the pin silently does nothing. Enforcing
 * that would mean Card owning the position through a named slot, which would
 * cost the flat composition this API is built around; it is left as a
 * convention instead. */
---

<footer class="card-actions">
  <slot />
</footer>

<style>
  .card-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--bravoixr-spacing-3);
    justify-content: flex-end;
    margin-block-start: auto;
    padding-block-start: var(--bravoixr-spacing-4);
  }
</style>
